{"url": "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/international/index.htm", "final_url": "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/international/index.htm", "status": 200, "method": "http", "fetched": "2026-11-14", "text": "International Students | UTRGV\nSkip to main content\nUTRGV Admissions | #1 Ranked University in Texas | Explore Programs & Deadlines\nFreshman\nTransfer\nInternational\nReturning\nGraduate\nNon-Degree\nFor Families\nApply Now\nVisit Campus\nExplore Programs\nRequest Info\nCheck Status\nContact Us\nDIRECTORY\nMAPS\nMYUTRGV\nNEWS\nGIVE\nThe University of Texas\nRio Grande Valley\nDIRECTORY\nMAPS\nMYUTRGV\nNews\nGIVE\nOpen Search Menu\nMenu\nSearch\nClear\nSearch\nAdmissions\nFreshman\nTransfer\nInternational\nReturning\nGraduate\nNon-Degree\nFor Families\nApply Now\nVisit Campus\nExplore Programs\nRequest Info\nCheck Status\nContact Us\nInternational Students\nHome\nInternational Students\nQuick Links\nInternational Student Services\nUndergraduate Apply Now\nGraduate Apply Now\nInternational Admissions\nWelcome to UTRGV! Whether you're looking to pursue an undergraduate or graduate degree, we\u2019re excited to welcome international students from all over the world.\nAt UTRGV, you'll find diverse academic programs, supportive faculty, and a vibrant campus community in the heart of the Rio Grande Valley. Explore the opportunities that await you, and discover the resources and guidance available to make your transition to studying in the U.S. smooth and successful.\nHow to Apply: UNDERGRADUATE Students How to Apply: GRADUATE Students\nMy Texas Future is a state-supported resource that helps Texans explore careers, find college programs, and access financial aid options to start, return to, or advance their education.\nClery Act\nThe Annual Security and Fire Safety Report includes information on safety and security policies, including crime and fire statistics for the previous three years.\nThe report is available on the University Police website. A hard copy of the report is available at the University Police Departments located on 501 N. Sugar Rd. (Edinburg), 2671 FJRM Ave. (Brownsville), 2102 Treasure Hills Blvd. (Harlingen), or 1937 East Bustamante Street (Laredo), also by contacting University Police at 956-882-7777.\nCARES, CRRSAA and ARP Reporting\nSite Policies\nRequired Links\nAccreditation Statement\nFraud Reporting\nSenate Bill 18\nClery Act Reports\nWeb Accessibility\nMental Health Resources\nSexual Misconduct Policy\nReporting Sexual Misconduct\nContact UTRGV\n1-844-ATUTRGV\nAcademics\nAdmissions\nCost and Financial Aid\nStudent Life\nSearch Programs\nFirst-Year Students\nTransfer\nInternational Students\nGraduate Students\nCurrent Students\nFaculty Resources\nStaff Resources\nUTRGV Careers\nVisit Campus\nDirectory\nThe University of Texas Rio Grande Valley", "links": [["Skip to main content", "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/international/index.htm#maincontent"], ["UTRGV Admissions | #1 Ranked University in Texas | Explore Programs & Deadlines", "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/index.htm"], ["Freshman", "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/freshman/index.htm"], ["Transfer", "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/transfer/index.htm"], ["International", "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/international/index.htm"], ["Returning", "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/returning/index.htm"], ["Graduate", "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/graduate/index.htm"], ["Non-Degree", "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/non-degree/index.htm"], ["For Families", "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/family/index.htm"], ["Apply Now", "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/info/apply/index.htm"], ["Visit Campus", "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/visit-campus/index.htm"], ["Explore Programs", "https://www.utrgv.edu/programs/index.htm"], ["Request Info", "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/info/request/index.htm"], ["Check Status", "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/info/check-status/index.htm"], ["Contact Us", "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/contact-us/ind